	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Hodie, quae ante dies complures ferebatur, postea (...?) evanuerat, iterum confirmatur <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p20183">Albanum</persName> discessisse.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName> sępius solere dicunt Iudęis suis indicere, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ex ditione ipsorum discedant; eam severitatem tantisper durare, donec pecuniari<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>a mulcta sese redemerint.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ita nunc quoque futurum censent; iusserunt enim <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nunc ipsos <placeName ref="l522">Veneti</placeName> spacio 15 mensium discedere, prout scripsi literis meis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sodomię <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vicium <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName>, imo viciniam nostram invasit et viros nimium claros; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>res satis patet multis; pervenient ad te forte ex aliis clariora, quam mihi nunc <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>scribere liceat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Res multis modis dolenda, quae tamen spe lętiori non caret, quod dominus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad finem festinare hinc ostenditur, quoniam impios, ut festinanter mensuram suam impleant, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cupiditatibus suis tradit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Imperator noster ab urbibus quibusdam obscurioribus, <placeName ref="l907">Campiduno</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>similibus pecuniam mutuam postulavit; quid impetrarit, nescio; multum dare, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>qui pauca possident, nequeunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ipsum etiamnum vehementer ęgrotare dicunt; insistunt <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>pontificii, ut ipsum in foedus suum propellant et ut aliquid adversus hęreticos conętur, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quod futurum fore minime dubitarem, si vires voluntati responderet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="date">[Ohne Datum.]</note>
					<note type="signature">[Ohne Unterschrift.]</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem ehrwirdigen unnd gelertten <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>heren <persName ref="p495">Henrichen Bullinger</persName>, die<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nerm der kirchen zu <placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>, meinem <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>lieben heren unnd freund.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Zürch.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Zwischen <persName ref="p20183">Albas</persName> Herrschaftsbeginn und <persName ref="p3740">G. v. Stettens</persName> Tod; wohl nach dem Erlaß vom 18. Dezember 1571 zur Ausweisung der <placeName ref="l522">venezianischen</placeName> Juden innert zweier Jahre.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
